"\"use strict\";Object.defineProperty(exports,\"__esModule\",{value:true});Object.defineProperty(exports,\"default\",{enumerable:true,get:function(){return MDXContent}});function _extends(){_extends=Object.assign||function(target){for(var i=1;i<arguments.length;i++){var source=arguments[i];for(var key in source){if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(source,key)){target[key]=source[key]}}}return target};return _extends.apply(this,arguments)}function _createMdxContent(props){var _components=_extends({a:\"a\",blockquote:\"blockquote\",em:\"em\",h2:\"h2\",p:\"p\",strong:\"strong\"},props.components);return Vue.h(Vue.Fragment,null,Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Here are some experiences and memories recorded, yet there is also a story that may be missing and can never be completed again.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"All of us (by which I mean all of us, both normal and not-so-normal) are imperfect human beings living in an imperfect world. We don’t live with the mechanical precision of a bank account or by measuring all our lines and angles with rulers and protractors. Am I right?\",Vue.h(\"sup\",null,Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-1\",id:\"footnote-ref-1\"},\"1\"))),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"An Experience\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Darker was a somewhat willful and stubborn girl, yet also one who was easy to like. She had considerable skill in rhythm games. She loved \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"Phigros\"),\", and she was pretty good at \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"maimai\"),\" too.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"She was very active on the Coolapk forum, liked tinkering with third-party kernels, and developed Magisk modules. It was through this that she got to know \",Vue.h(_components.a,{href:\"../profile/qcm45\"},\"Mengmeng\"),\", and also Shiroshita\",Vue.h(\"sup\",null,Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-2\",id:\"footnote-ref-2\"},\"2\")),\".\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"As for her avatar… it came from Monica in \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"Doki Doki Literature Club!\"),\". Perhaps it was also because she feared a \",Vue.h(_components.strong,null,\"loneliness\"),\" like Monica’s. In the summer of 2023, she traveled a long way from Guangxi to Suzhou to find Mengmeng.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In October, she went north to Harbin—a city covered in ice and snow—where Shiroshita was living. She stayed there for quite a long time and had a happy stretch of days, and she and Mengmeng even went out together and got haircuts they were satisfied with.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Later she adopted a cat, named Conflict, which was later renamed Xiao Ke, also known as Clash. And then she reenacted a classic image: Clash is proxying your network traffic!\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Unfortunately, in early April, around Qingming, she suddenly \",Vue.h(_components.strong,null,\"went missing\"),\" after returning to Guangxi. Shiroshita and Mengmeng later learned that she had been sent to a conversion school.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"They began trying to find a way to get her out. Together with Maho Citrus, they added Darker’s mother on WeChat. Although the chatting was more or less okay, there was no actual effect.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"At the end of August, Mengmeng passed away. Maho Citrus used this as a reason to ask Darker’s parents to take her out of the conversion school. Darker’s parents agreed, but Darker was transferred from an ordinary high school to a vocational high school. Her parents required her to finish the college entrance exam and cut off all contact with the trans community.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"She was devastated, feeling that her temporary absence had caused Mengmeng’s death.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Without anyone noticing, I lost something.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Before I realized it, you were already gone. Only memories remained.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"When I’m busy, it’s like being a puppet that has lost its words. Like a stray cat on every street. Everything I hear is unrecognizable.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"If only I could see you again, I would want to say just one thing.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Thank you… thank you…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"(September 20, 2024)\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"She missed Mengmeng all the time. In the new semester, in her new class, she saw a classmate whose build and hairstyle were so similar that it made her dazed, reminding her of the Mengmeng who had once been by her side.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In November, since Darker was already an adult by then, she made up her mind to \",Vue.h(_components.strong,null,\"escape\"),\" Guangxi. She set out from Liuzhou and rode the train all the way north, and came once more to Harbin, the city covered in ice and snow—except that Mengmeng’s figure was no longer in this city.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"She continued to stay at Shiroshita’s home, but the laughter and joy of former days gradually faded.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"At the end of the year, her parents asked her to come home to handle the matter of registering for the college entrance exam, and it was then that misfortune occurred.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“Sorry, the pressure of life is too great. I can’t hold on anymore…” After a goodnight, there was no more news from her.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Maho Citrus worried about her safety and once again contacted her parents in Guangxi, only to learn the news that she had unfortunately passed away.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"A Memory\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"When you get down to it, Darker was actually my fan from the very beginning.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"At that time, I happened to be writing practical tutorials about tinkering with devices on the Coolapk forum. Because one of my articles gained a lot of traffic and received an official push, I took the opportunity to establish my own fan group. Darker joined through public channels.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"But once, she suddenly said in the group that she was feeling down, that she was having thoughts of ending it all. Of course I couldn’t just stand by, so I tried to talk her around, and afterward we became friends. As for how the relationship got better… I’ve somewhat forgotten.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Until July 2023, when I really couldn’t stand the restrictions at home anymore, I decided to go south from the northeast to Suzhou to find Mengmeng. When Darker learned of this, she insisted on coming along, so the two of us both ended up in Suzhou at that time.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I couldn’t isolate her… but as a mere friend, I also couldn’t take care of her…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Epilogue\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Not long after Darker passed away, Shiroshita also attempted suicide. When everything was about to reach its end, she still chose to dial 120.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"The ambulance came very promptly, and she was thus fortunate enough to be saved. But when she woke up, both Darker and Mengmeng were already no longer in this world.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Now the old matters have drifted away, but those past days still feel vivid.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“Those two… are children who will never grow up. And now they never will.”\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“Will you miss them?”\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“I feel some nostalgia… for that time, for those unbridled days.”\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"ol\",null,Vue.h(\"li\",{id:\"footnote-1\"},\"From \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"Norwegian Wood\"),\" by Haruki Murakami, translated by Jay Rubin; Chapter 10\",Vue.h(\